{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:35 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:35 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:35 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧（左）與男友齊到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/616e1a1eedefbeba0c80b151a2688d5a/2026-11/179438950860125.jpg\"/><p>今晚奧璇璧將首度在跑馬地馬場上陣，賽前她與男友Sam Cavanough齊齊到場，兩人更齊踩草地熟習此馬場形勢。Sam Cavanough同為馬圈中人，現時在澳洲馬漢雅馬房工作。今晚奧璇璧共策六駒上陣，且看能否順利打開在港勝門。</p><img alt=\"打卡留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d8fd56ea603294b014db03e9a3203b63/2026-11/179438953464981.jpeg\" title=\"打卡留念。\"/><p>打卡留念。</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧（右）與男友齊行草地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/835daaa894ec54f292e815aca5c86336/2026-11/179438953459815.jpg\" title=\"奧璇璧（右）與男友齊行草地。\"/><p>奧璇璧（右）與男友齊行草地。</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧男友Sam Cavanough\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13c9da48b7d20b11fc28002e047705ca/2026-11/Sam_Cavanough.jpg\" title=\"奧璇璧男友Sam Cavanough\"/><p>奧璇璧男友Sam Cavanough</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.430850+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:35:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:57:34.543384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:30.582000+00:00","content_hash":"4e5172ef8c8d00cf330cb6e9dff0701ea1dd29740fd36cbf21ae753b7e410ea4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}